  "guide": "Here `Limit` is $A$, `trace` is $\\tau$, and `rootFlag n` is $f_n$. The source index `i` is the index $j$ used here. The expression `transportedFlag family i n` is $\\alpha_j(f_n)=f_{j,n}$. The right-hand side is the reciprocal of $2^n$, regarded as a complex scalar, so the source equality is precisely $\\tau(f_{j,n})=2^{-n}$.",
